# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
#
# The release keystore and its passwords are NOT committed. CI signs by
# decoding the keystore from a GitHub Actions secret (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64)
# and passing the passwords via env vars; for local release builds, create your
# own key.properties pointing at your backed-up keystore (see app/README.md).
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
